<title>HONG KONG: Prime Success negotiating higher JV stake.</title>
<headline>Prime Success negotiating higher JV stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Footwear manufacturer Prime Success International Group Ltd said it was negotiating the acquisition of a controlling equity interest in a joint venture enterprise in China.</p>
<p>&quot;The negotiation has not been finalized and the acquisition may or may not be proceeded,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Prime Success said it had a minority stake in the venture but it gave no further details.</p>
<p>Its shares ended HK$0.13 or 8.13 percent higher on Thursday at HK$1.73 per share.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
